rson_id":"8x5_e5i_yle","status":"contextual"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-duyu:p025:u0146","start":146,"end":147,"surface":"之","kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","note":"秀雖銜之：可為錫亦可為拒交一事，未強指人物。","classification":"ambiguous_person_or_event","person_id":null},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-duyu:p025:m0149","start":149,"end":150,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"opc_jvk_p6i","status":"contextual"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-duyu:p025:m0158","start":158,"end":160,"surface":"惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"7e0_f69_1ac","status":"contextual"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-duyu:p025:m0196","start":196,"end":197,"surface":"乂","kind":"person","person_id":"a2u_2ji_h68","status":"contextual"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-duyu:p025:w0201","start":201,"end":204,"surface":"外戚傳","kind":"work","work_id":"w-jinshu","status":"source_explicit","person_id":null}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-034-duyu","book_id":"b-jinshu-034","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-034-ws2567662-duyu"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051","text":"裒少有簡貴之風，與京兆杜乂俱有盛名，冠于中興。譙國桓彝見而目之曰：「季野有皮裏春秋。」言其外無臧否，而內有所褒貶也。謝安亦雅重之，恆云：「裒雖不言，而四時之氣亦備矣。」初辟西陽王掾、吳王文學。蘇峻之構逆也，車騎將軍郗鑒以裒為參軍。峻平，以功封都鄉亭侯，稍遷司徒從事中郎，除給事黃門侍郎。康帝為琅邪王時，將納妃，妙選素望，詔娉裒女為妃，於是出為豫章太守。及康帝即位，徵拜侍中，遷尚書。以后父，苦求外出，除建威將軍、江州刺史，鎮半洲。在官清約，雖居方伯，恆使私童樵採。頃之，徵為衛將軍，領中書令。裒以中書銓管詔命，不宜以姻戚居之，固讓，詔以為左將卦、兗州刺史、都督兗州徐州之琅邪諸軍事、假節，鎮金城，又領琅邪內史。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"裒","kind":"person","person_id":"xke_dj3_6ba_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"杜乂","kind":"person","person_id":"a2u_2ji_h68","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"桓彝","kind":"person","person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"季野","kind":"person","person_id":"xke_dj3_6ba_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"謝安","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0069","start":69,"end":70,"surface":"裒","kind":"person","person_id":"xke_dj3_6ba_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0086","start":86,"end":89,"surface":"西陽王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"卷七及五十九支持西陽王羕；待匯入亮之子羕的原文親屬斷言，再以司馬亮支正式配號，避免建立無可解析親屬路徑的家族 ID。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"qpk_4pt_y6r","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本紀咸和元年封皇弟岳為吳王、二年改琅邪王，與本傳蘇峻亂前任吳王文學及後文康帝為琅邪王相合；不據此倒定授官年。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"蘇峻","kind":"person","person_id":"lrg_cze_g1l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"郗鑒","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0110","start":110,"end":111,"surface":"裒","kind":"person","person_id":"xke_dj3_6ba_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0115","start":115,"end":116,"surface":"峻","kind":"person","person_id":"lrg_cze_g1l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0143","start":143,"end":145,"surface":"康帝","kind":"person","person_id":"qpk_4pt_y6r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0146","start":146,"end":149,"surface":"琅邪王","kind":"person","person_id":"qpk_4pt_y6r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0162","start":162,"end":163,"surface":"裒","kind":"person","person_id":"xke_dj3_6ba_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0177","start":177,"end":179,"surface":"康帝","kind":"person","person_id":"qpk_4pt_y6r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line051:m0246","start":246,"end":247,"surface":"裒","kind":"person","person_id":"xke_dj3_6ba_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"first_line":51,"last_line":51,"revision_id":1548000,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":false},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou","book_id":"b-jinshu-093","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-093-chupou"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit044","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","text":"杜氏新書曰恕弟理字務仲少而機察精要畿竒之故名之曰理年二十一而卒弟寛字務叔清虚玄静敏而好古以名臣門户少長京師而篤志博學絶於世務其意欲探賾索隐由此顯名當塗之士多交焉舉孝廉除郎中年四十二而卒經傳之義多所論駁皆草創未就惟刪集禮記及春秋左氏傳觧今存于世預字元凱司馬宣王女壻王隐晉書稱預智謨淵博明於理亂常稱徳者非所以企及立功立言所庶幾也大觀羣典謂公羊穀梁詭辯之言又非先儒說左氏未究丘明意而橫以二傳亂之乃錯綜㣲言著春秋左氏經傳集觧又參考衆家謂之釋例又作盟㑹圖春秋長歴備成一家之學至老乃成尚書郎摰虞甚重之曰左丘明本為春秋作傳而左傳遂自孤行釋例本為傳設而所發明何但左傳故亦孤行預有大功名於晉室位至征南大將軍開府封當陽侯食邑八千户子錫字世嘏尚書左丞晉諸公贊曰嘏有氣局預從兄斌字世將亦有才望為黃門郎為趙王倫所枉殺嘏子乂字洪治少有令名為丹陽丞早卒阮武者亦拓落大才也案阮氏譜武父諶字士信徵辟無所就造三禮圖傳於世杜氏新書曰武字文業闊達博通淵雅之士位止清河太守武弟炳字叔文河南尹精意醫術撰藥方一部炳子坦字弘舒晉太子少傅平東將軍坦弟柯字士度荀綽兖州記曰坦出紹伯父亡次兄當襲爵父愛柯言名傳之遂承封時㓜小不能讓及長悔恨遂幅巾而居後雖出身未嘗釋也性純篤閑雅好禮無違存心經誥博學洽聞選為濮陽王文學遷領軍長史喪官王衍時為領軍哭之甚慟","source_position":{"source_layer":"pei_annotation","first_line":391,"last_line":406,"raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/sgz016-duji-dushu/fixed-complete-unit.json"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit044:w0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"杜氏新書","kind":"work","person_id":null,"work_id":"w-dushi-xinshu-sgz016-reference","status":"source_explicit"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit044:m0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"恕","kind":"person","person_id":"ip4_zrh_ttx","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳子恕嗣、務伯及幽州刺史，與034杜預父恕幽州刺史/幽死為具體父子官履橋。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit044:m0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"理","kind":"person","person_id":"1v2_fto_d6i","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"杜氏新書明恕弟理字務仲、畿名之；保名省姓來源，不預父邊或年二十一生日。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit044:m0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"務仲","kind":"person","person_id":"1v2_fto_d6i","status":"contextual_prov